  "premise_review": [
    "Preserve every exact implicit C/F/nabla/Hflow/e/D/H/T/N parameter, all explicit @ applications and the complete explicit B : IndexToBoundaryAlignmentBridge C F nabla Hflow e D H T N hypothesis. No original type, proof term or nested dependency is narrowed or substituted.",
