    "Unlike a same-source type extraction, this wrapper already imports Folder.CrystallineIndex.IndexBoundaryAlignmentBridge, supplying its complete original B type. No new legacy self-import, alias, weaker substitute type or newly reviewed GRWTSK provider is used.",
